Z||000000||FieroKyle||12-04-2001||12:29 AM||||I bought a real 8 ball, not those crappy hollowed cheap plastic ones at the auto store.<P>Anyways I drilled it, tapped and put it on and it looks great! I love it! May be I will get pics of it soon. I did this on a metal lathe at work, turned out great. Even feels great in your hand.<P>I thought about drilling it back out and putting a metal sleeve and epoxy it on the inside so my plastic threads don't strip.<P>If any of you guys are interested, may be I will consider making them and selling them for what I got into it and shipping. Just an idea. I could take orders for what ever ball ya wanted.<P>Anyways if anyone has pics of theirs or someone else's, that would be cool.<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fierokylesig_1.gif">      <P>My Fast 'n Black Car<BR>Kyle - 85' GT||||reg||10
